{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7d8e80ae2ae48dd2","name":"Corellian Slip","source":{"id":"source:reference-7d8e80ae2ae48dd2","title":"Corellian Slip","revision":18675,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:32:12Z","sha256":"735f6be19aa3375e47fcb74e5e64fa6abf9361293eef7b9f02f58717eeafa57b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18675","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20Slip&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7d8e80ae2ae48dd2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A teamwork-focused ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," tactic, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Corellian Slip"]}," maneuver allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," to destroy an opposing Starship that threatens one of his or her allies by flying at the enemy vessel head-on.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," within (2 x your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},") squares.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check."]}," When you activate this maneuver, you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to twice your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," in a straight line through your opponent's square. If something halts your movement before you enter your opponent's square (such as being drawn into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},"), the maneuver fails to activate. When you enter your opponent's square, you make an attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," against the target. The result of the check determines the effects, if any:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["If you destroy your target with your attack, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," does not occur.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You receive a +1 circumstance bonus to your attack roll. Additionally, if you destroy your target with your attack, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," does not occur.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You receive a +1 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and deal +1 die of damage. Additionally, if you destroy your target with your attack, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," does not occur.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You receive a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and deal +1 die of damage. Additionally, if you destroy your target with your attack, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," does not occur.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["35\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You receive a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and deal +2 dice of damage. Additionally, if you destroy your target with your attack, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," does not occur.\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you fail to successfully activate this maneuver, you still move through your opponent's square and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," occurs. You do not get to make an attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", and you cannot make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Avoid Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Avoid_Collision"},". (Your opponent may do so, however.)\n"]},"\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
